h2><p>While my conceptual implementation of a KV cache above helps with cla=
rity and is mainly geared towards code readability and educational purposes=
, deploying it in real-world scenarios (especially with larger models and l=
onger sequence lengths) requires more careful optimization.</p><h3 class=3D=
"header-anchor-post"><strong>Common Pitfalls When Scaling the Cache</strong=
><div class=3D"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-ab=
solute pc-reset header-anchor-parent"><div class=3D"pencraft pc-display-con=
