ng>Memory fragmentation and repeated allocations</strong><span>: Continuous=
ly concatenating tensors via </span><code>torch.cat</code><span>, as shown =
earlier, leads to performance bottlenecks due to frequent memory allocation=
 and reallocation.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Linear growth in memory us=
age</strong><span>: Without proper handling, the KV cache size becomes impr=
actical for very long sequences.</span></p></li></ul><h4 class=3D"header-an=
chor-post"><strong>Tip 1: Pre-allocate Memory</strong><div class=3D"pencraf=
