    (batch_size, num_heads, max_seq_len, head_dim), device=3Ddevice
)</code></pre><p>During inference, we can then simply write into slices of =
these pre-allocated tensors.</p><h4 class=3D"header-anchor-post"><strong>Ti=
p 2: Truncate Cache via Sliding Window</strong><div class=3D"pencraft pc-di=
